ily:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million as of December 31, 2025 and 2024</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, respectively.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div>
