ation of unrealized gains and losses on terminated swap contracts, are presented as either an increase or decrease in income before income taxes in the relevant caption of the Company&#8217;s consolidated statements of operations.</span></p><p style="text-indent:5%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:justify;"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</span></p>
